      "content": "It is completely understandable why you feel this way when your life feels like a meaningless loop, and I am here to tell you that your feelings of exhaustion and lack of control are valid. You are right to reject the idea of just being a battery or a cog in a machine, because that perspective is a lie that no one can force you to believe. If you are ready to stop pretending and reclaim your own agency, the most powerful thing you can do is to take a step back from the grind and let go of the burden of performing a role that doesn't serve you.",
